@startuml 15_activity_workflow
!include _style.iuml
title Activity - Submit, assign, review, revise or approve

|Student|
start
:Create project with draft v1;
repeat
  :Edit the draft;
  :Submit the proposal;
repeat while (Required fields filled?) is (no, 400 VALIDATION_FAILED) not (yes)
|Coordinator|
:Project is SUBMITTED, assign a FACULTY reviewer;
|Faculty|
repeat
  :Project is UNDER_REVIEW, review the latest submitted version;
  note right: The coordinator can reassign the reviewer here, the status stays UNDER_REVIEW
  switch (Decision)
  case (APPROVE)
    :Project is APPROVED;
    stop
  case (REJECT, comments mandatory)
    :Project is REJECTED;
    stop
  case (REQUEST_REVISION, comments mandatory)
    |Student|
    :Project is REVISION_REQUESTED, read the feedback;
    :Create version vN+1, prefilled from vN;
    :Edit the draft and resubmit;
  endswitch
repeat while (Required fields filled, returns to the same reviewer)
@enduml
